},"spell8":{"castPerDayOffsetFormula":"","preparedOffsetFormula":""},"spell9":{"castPerDayOffsetFormula":"","preparedOffsetFormula":""}},"spellSlotAbilityBonusFormula":"","domainSlotValue":1}}},"cmb":{}},"details":{"height":"","weight":"","gender":"","deity":"","age":"","alignment":"tn","biography":{"value":""},"bonusFeatFormula":"","bonusSkillRankFormula":"","carryCapacity":{"bonus":{"user":0},"multiplier":{"base":1,"user":0}},"notes":{"value":"<div style=\"margin-top:15px;margin-bottom:5px;text-align:center;font-size:1em;font-weight:900\"><p>sbc | Generated with version 6.0.3 on November 19, 2026</p></div><hr /><div class=\"statblockContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><p></p><div class=\"sbcStatBlock\"><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /><div style=\"padding:5px\"><h1>Giant Wasp <ul class=\"sbcSlashList\">   </ul></h1>  <hr /><div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"base\"> <strong>Source</strong> PFRPG Bestiary<br /> <strong>XP</strong> 800<br />     <br /> N  Large  Vermin  <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">    </ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\"><li><strong>Init</strong>  +1</li>  <li><strong>Senses</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"senses\">  <li>Darkvision 60 ft</li>  </ul></li>   <span><strong>Perception</strong> +9</span>  </ul><br />  </div><div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"defense\"><h4>Defense</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\"><li><strong>AC</strong> 14</li><li><strong>Touch</strong> 10</li><li><strong>Flat-footed</strong> 13</li></ul>  <ul class=\"sbcParensWrappedList sbcCommaList\" data-group=\"armor\">  <li>+1 Dex</li>  <li>+4 Natural</li>  <li>-1 Size</li>  </ul>  <br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\"><li><strong>Hit Points</strong> 34 (4 HD; 4d8+16)</li>  </ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\"><li><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"saves\"><li><strong>Fort</strong> +8</li><li><strong>Ref</strong> +2</li><li><strong>Will</strong> +2</li></ul></li>   </ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">    <li><strong>Immune</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"immune\">  <li>Mind-affecting</li>  </ul></li>     </ul>  </div><div><div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 20 ft</li>  <li>Fly 60 ft (Good)</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> sting +6 (1d8+6  plus poison)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">  <li><strong>Space</strong> 10 ft</li>   <li><strong>Reach</strong> 5 ft</li>  </ul> <br />  </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 18</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 12</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 18</li><li><strong>Int</strong>  —</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 13</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 11</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+3</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> +8</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 19  </li></ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Fly +3</li>  <li>Perception +9</li>  </ul>  <br />     </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   temperate forests <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary, pair, group (3-6), or nest (7-19)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  none   <br />  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"special-abilities\"><h4> Special Abilities </h4><hr />  <p><strong>Poison (Ex)</strong> Sting-injury; save Fort DC 18; frequency 1/round for 6 rounds; effect 1d2 Dexterity damage; cure 1 save. The save DC is Constitution-based, and includes a +2 racial bonus.    </p>  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nGiant wasps nearly always form nests, though not like their much smaller cousins. Each nest functions with one leader (the queen), a few workers, and several soldiers.\n\nThe workers and the queen produce offspring while the soldiers protect the nest and hunt for food. Giant wasp nests are typically found in caves, abandoned houses, or any complex large enough to fit a dozen 10-foottall insects.\n\nGiant wasps attack when hungry or threatened, stinging their prey to death. They take dead or incapacitated opponents back to their lairs as food for their unhatched young-the experience of lying in a wasp nest, paralyzed while its grubs feed, is one of nature's cruelest inventions.\n\nEven when part of a nest, giant wasps tend toward solitary hunting, and it's rare to see more than one at a time.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Giant Wasp (CR 3)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 3 \nXP 800 \nN Large vermin  \nInit +1; Senses darkvision 60 ft.; Perception +9   \nDefense   \nAC 14, touch 10, flat-footed 13 (+1 Dex, +4 natural, -1 size)\n\nhp 34 (4d8+16)\n\nFort +8, Ref +2, Will +2 \nImmune mind-affecting effects   \nOffense   \nSpd 20 ft., fly 60 ft. (good)\n\nMelee sting +6 (1d8+6  plus poison)\n\nSpace 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft.   \nStatistics   \nStr 18, Dex 12, Con 18, Int -,  Wis 13, Cha 11 \nBase Atk +3; CMB +8; CMD 19 \nSkills Fly +3, Perception +9; Racial Modifiers +8 Perception   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  temperate forests \nOrganization solitary, pair, group (3-6), or nest (7-19)\n\nTreasure none   \nSpecial abilities   \nPoison (Ex) Sting-injury; save Fort DC 18; frequency 1/round for 6 rounds; effect 1d2 Dexterity damage; cure 1 save. The save DC is Constitution-based, and includes a +2 racial bonus.   \nDescription\n\nGiant wasps nearly always form nests, though not like their much smaller cousins. Each nest functions with one leader (the queen), a few workers, and several soldiers.\n\nThe workers and the queen produce offspring while the soldiers protect the nest and hunt for food. Giant wasp nests are typically found in caves, abandoned houses, or any complex large enough to fit a dozen 10-foottall insects.\n\nGiant wasps attack when hungry or threatened, stinging their prey to death. They take dead or incapacitated opponents back to their lairs as food for their unhatched young-the experience of lying in a wasp nest, paralyzed while its grubs feed, is one of nature's cruelest inventions.\n\nEven when part of a nest, giant wasps tend toward solitary hunting, and it's rare to see more than one at a time.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":3},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"in